      "start_seconds": 16.95,
      "end_seconds": 35.16,
      "duration_seconds": 18.21,
      "text": "It's a sudden severe tummy pain. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone. Work has been very busy so I kept ignoring it. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite."
